; abnf stdio.semio.brep snapshot (dsl/text payload)
; the DSL text is a whitespace-tolerant ASCII hex dump of the REAL JSON-pack bytes of a
; SemioBrepSnapshot (see ../🔣️component.json for that payload's own structure) -- the snapshot
; has no textual syntax of its own; this restates the ../📖️component.grammar.semio production for
; a self-contained ABNF reading.
document = hex-byte *(WS hex-byte)
hex-byte = HEXDIG HEXDIG
WS = *(%x20 / %x09 / %x0D / %x0A)
